ains no prerequisite predicates, so no prerequisite truth was fabricated.\n\n## Artifacts\n\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-candidates.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-provisional-layer.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-accepted-layer.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-rejected-layer.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-review-queue.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-cycle-direction-validator.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.readback.md\n\n## Exact Counts\n\n- Represented rows: 3530\n- Source layer entries: 3530\n- Source semantic assertions: 3\n- Source blocked/quarantined entries: 3527\n- Source prerequisite candidates: 0\n- Candidate prerequisites: 0\n- Accepted prerequisites: 0\n- Provisional prerequisites: 0\n- Rejected prerequisites: 0\n- Review queue tasks: 0\n- Reversed direction candidates: 0\n- Ambiguous direction candidates: 0\n- Cycles: 0\n- Suspicious weak chains: 0\n- External model calls: 0\n\n## Validation\n\n- node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.mjs --write: pass, validator status pass, 15/15 checks pass.\n- npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.test.js: pass, 8/8 tests pass.\n- npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json: exit 0; top_status warning only for branch ownership; worktree clean; upstream synchronized; artifact guard healthy.\n- npm run lint:changed: exit 0 but skipped untracked JS before staging, so direct fallback was used.\n- ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.test.js: pass.\n- node --check scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.mjs: pass.\n- node --check scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-prerequisite-graph.test.js: pass.\n- git diff --check: pass.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- External model calls: 0.\n- No Supabase mutation.\n- No frontend UI work.\n- No production RAG reindex.\n- Did not start #1328, #1329, #1330, #1331, or #1332.\n\n## Blockers / Review Notes\n\n- No blockers.\n- Current upstream has no real prerequisite candidates in accepted/provisional/review-required inputs; accepted and provisional prerequisite counts are intentionally 0.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T04:15:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T04:17:25Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T04:17:14Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T04:17:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"964c0c33ce0096c2f39840f569e7ac9027592b39","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1354/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1354/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1354/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/c84bf13bec6c512e3bd567ca57b40aa0b5194265","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1327","ref":"feat/issue-1327","sha":"c84bf13bec6c512e3bd567ca57b40aa0b5194265","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su